WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:18.620
Kyrgyzstan - more than 90 per cent of the country is
mountainous,

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.240
with peaks up to 7-thousand 500 meters high.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.200
Most Kyrgyz people live from farming
or animal husbandry.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.880
The climate is harsh and the cuisine is - rustic.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:40.800
Baking is often done in a clay oven - for
example, to produce the traditional flatbread

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.940
of the region called lepyoshka.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.500
It's a simple snack - but an attractive one.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.760
Flour, sugar, butter, salt and yeast make
up the dough and off it goes into the oven.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:58.399
After baking for 15 minutes - the lepyoshka
are done.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.100
They sell for around 35 cents apiece.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.300
13 year old Rosahun delivers them to the market
every morning.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:11.660
Marmur has been making them for 10 years in
this family-owned bakery.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.130
He bakes 500 lepyoshkas a day.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:15.380
It's a good business.

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:29.600
“People always aks for this bread for occasions like funerals or weddings.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.700
It's a popular bread and it's a staple for
us.”

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:42.920
Although the bakery is a bit out of the way,
the customers always stop by to pick up their

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.040
lepyoshka - fresh from the oven.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.020
The flatbread is served at nearly every meal
in Kyrgyzstan.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.980
The regulars come in the morning to stock
up for the day.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.560
“It tastes good - it's warm and it's pleasant
to eat.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.870
I always buy the bread here because it's always
fresh.”

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:14.520
The bakers intend to pass on the bread recipe
to the next generation.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:20.080
They're certain that lepyoshka will retain
its popularity in Kyrgyzstan for years to come.

